  "html": "<p><b>Quest Giver:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Panickee\" title=\"Sir Panickee\">Sir Panickee</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</p><p><b>Quest Type:</b> Hunt\n</p><p><b>Quest Description:</b> Destroy Kog's Army located off Level 3 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Kog's_Gearbox\" title=\"Kog's Gearbox\">Kog's Gearbox</a> and return to <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Panickee\" title=\"Sir Panickee\">Sir Panickee</a> on Level 2 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>. Slay <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a> (10), <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warrior</a> (10), <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scout</a> (10), <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodling</a> (10), <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Poison Blademaster</a> (10), <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitter</a> (10), <a href=\"/wiki/Kog_the_Mighty\" title=\"Kog the Mighty\">Kog the Mighty</a> (1).\n</p><p><b>Quest Reward:</b> 1250 Gold\n</p><p><b>Return to:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Panickee\" title=\"Sir Panickee\">Sir Panickee</a>\n</p><p><b>Repeatable:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Repeatable\" title=\"Repeatable\">Yes</a>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
